WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.300
An interview research assistant that fact-checks its own work.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.850
Enter a company, and a quick check searches public visa sponsorship records.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.450
Every yes must quote a real source, or it's marked unknown.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:17.100
Next, the full briefing: a Researcher gathers claims, and an Editor re-checks them.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.400
You review every labeled claim before anything is written.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:25.000
The result: a cited briefing, with uncertain claims flagged.
